{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, they are approaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a detective who has entered the scene to search for a person who went missing at a haunted location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, \u201csomething\u201d was approaching the detective\u2014a gaze, footsteps, and a presence closing in from behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game played from a first-person perspective. Can you safely escape from the terrifying abandoned house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will explore the darkness. When sounds play or enemies stare at you within the stage, the fear meter rises. If the fear meter fills up, you will be attacked by enemies and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 This is a short horror game. There is no save function.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Sudden loud noises may occur.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 This game may be streamed on video streaming sites by both individuals and companies. Monetization is also permitted.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878340?t=1755536190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878340?t=1755536190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878340/975debf2af34f8a21471a1ec5b1d1673f77d7d40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755536190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878340/975debf2af34f8a21471a1ec5b1d1673f77d7d40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755536190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains horror elements, suspenseful chase scenes, and depictions of death such as visible corpses. It does not include graphic violence, sexual content, drug or alcohol use, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, they are approaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a detective who has entered the scene to search for a person who went missing at a haunted location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, \u201csomething\u201d was approaching the detective\u2014a gaze, footsteps, and a presence closing in from behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game played from a first-person perspective. Can you safely escape from the terrifying abandoned house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will explore the darkness. When sounds play or enemies stare at you within the stage, the fear meter rises. If the fear meter fills up, you will be attacked by enemies and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 This is a short horror game. There is no save function.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Sudden loud noises may occur.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 This game may be streamed on video streaming sites by both individuals and companies. Monetization is also permitted.</p>","developers":["\u9ed2\u5b50\u30e9\u30dc"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878340/26c1dc784c60b8b20e9b0adb3a523a0e4e714404/header.jpg?t=1755536190","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3878340/616805274/038c47439b696b075a2e1a1df52c1d3e21f591d7/1753852219/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754094114","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3878340/616805274/038c47439b696b075a2e1a1df52c1d3e21f591d7/1753852219/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754094114","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic